From: YapLabs <folia@yaplabs.com>
Subject: [PATCH] YaP spawn portal: exact-key cuts, pin nether frames

Packed-spawn cuts stay. Ticket/unload use this-world corridor keys only so
an overworld AABB does not clamp nether dest search. Pin loaded nether/end
portal chunks and portal-travel tickets; do not MAX+1 unload a pinned
holder. Post-applyAllPatches.
